  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Square X has a side length of <math alttext=\"12\"><mn>12</mn>\n</math> centimeters. The perimeter of square Y is <math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math> times the perimeter of square X. What is the length, in centimeters, of one side of square Y?</p>",
